Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.89,0:00:13.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.51,0:00:17.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you do this?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.59,0:00:22.73,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,I created it from spirit force taken from you\Nand material sprites I stocked up.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.29,0:00:25.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is creation magic, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.43,0:00:25.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can I control it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's your spirit force.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should know better.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.68,0:00:31.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How will you use it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.46,0:00:34.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be the bait.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't leave this space even if it was open,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.61,0:00:39.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,unless they take us out.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.33,0:00:40.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you must retrieve the copy,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or you lose cultivation.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.63,0:00:43.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.68,0:00:45.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we'll let them believe we can leave.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.98,0:00:46.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.51,0:00:49.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got Muluo immortal's soul stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.67,0:00:50.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.39,0:00:57.97,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same two as before.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.41,0:00:59.07,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.25,0:00:59.99,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.61,0:01:01.18,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.27,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,It's time you kept your promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.19,0:01:04.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it turns out they can sense us, we call it off.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.89,0:01:06.41,Main Dialogue Top Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's strange you can't see those three?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.21,0:01:07.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We revert behind the screen and come out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.59,0:01:07.40,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.37,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,So your closed eyes are just a facade.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.53,0:01:11.25,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,I thought you rely on spirit sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a lock-up master.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.62,0:01:13.31,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed they already left?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.38,0:01:12.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's unlikely he senses us.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.99,0:01:16.37,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,None of you can leave this spirit space.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.74,0:01:16.68,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,We draw his attention to the copy, and make him lose confidence.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.50,0:01:17.70,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.83,0:01:19.39,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,None of you are space type.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.53,0:01:21.13,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,How do you know we can't leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.13,0:01:22.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's going to doubt himself.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.93,0:01:23.69,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Qiuxian.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.50,0:01:27.41,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Among them, only the old frog can sense spirit bodies.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So if they don't see you,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they will believe you aren't there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.09,0:01:35.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We move the moment I retrieved the copy.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.59,0:01:37.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As fast as we can, we hide on him.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.93,0:01:40.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will be so light,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.52,0:01:41.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he surely won't notice us.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.47,0:01:44.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless they discover us,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.85,0:01:48.20,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,there's no way for the two of them\Nto tell we're still there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.44,0:01:49.57,Internal Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.29,0:01:51.10,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,Stay here and watch.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.37,Main Dialogue Top,,0,0,0,,I call Polao in.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.48,0:01:54.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He controls this space.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.26,0:01:57.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only he can bring people in and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.51,0:01:59.98,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,We don't know where he takes us,\Nthis can pose a risk.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.67,0:02:02.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since they already found the Pearl,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they must be somewhere in the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.14,0:02:07.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The top of a building would be the best for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.98,0:02:11.42,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,They'll be distracted while he's explaining the situation to the others.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.53,0:02:13.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They won't notice a rice-sized object falling.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.48,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,We teleport before the space switch could be cut.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.19,0:02:18.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that's when we escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,596)}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.78,0:02:23.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So adorable!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So {\i1}kawaii{\i0}!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.03,0:02:31.99,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should've stayed home...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.90,0:02:34.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.07,0:02:40.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.93,0:02:43.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it's your friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.35,0:02:48.27,Episode title 23,,0,0,0,,{\pos(466,536)}Escape and Battle
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say this space is infallible?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.65,0:02:50.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They must have abilities unknown to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.23,0:02:52.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you be more careful?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The unknown is to be feared.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.02,0:02:58.20,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Even the strongest spirit space can't nullify every power.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.79,0:03:01.70,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine what ability could take them out of there.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could have stayed to watch them.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of promise breakers...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember, they aren't our objective.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.25,0:03:10.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though we must act quickly.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I thought, we're near the con.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.99,0:03:17.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will be our next step?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.03,0:03:20.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still remember you guys are after the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.21,0:03:24.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're frank.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.68,0:03:25.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We take our leave now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.97,0:03:26.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't steal it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.64,0:03:26.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.30,0:03:28.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was fun working with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope next time we can have a good long talk.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.60,0:03:34.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Luo.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.69,0:03:34.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.66,0:03:36.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Soul Calling Stone we gave you...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.26,0:03:39.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.59,0:03:41.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact, we used it...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.45,0:03:44.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to sense your approximate location.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.32,0:03:45.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No wonder you found me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.60,0:03:47.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.85,0:03:49.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemies make the best friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can remove the tracking.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I still can use it to contact you, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.99,0:03:54.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.27,0:03:56.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You tried in vain this time too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.40,0:03:59.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cultivation is never child's play.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.13,0:04:01.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.95,0:04:02.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we will.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.45,0:04:08.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.26,0:04:12.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.41,0:04:16.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you were even more so.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.95,0:04:17.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shan Xin!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.28,0:04:19.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.26,0:04:20.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a contest! I can win a limited edition game!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.86,0:04:26.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come there's not a single place to hide...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I just cross the road, they'll see me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.43,0:04:34.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Had I known, I'd have brought my cell phone...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't know Xiaobai's number...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.71,0:04:38.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They walk in plain sight?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.26,0:04:40.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is safe?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.85,0:04:42.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have observed the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.27,0:04:43.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of masquerade.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.45,0:04:46.77,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,If we keep a low profile,\Nno one will pay attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.97,0:04:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you were wrong!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.76,0:04:55.20,Main Dialogue Left Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- So lifelike!\N- Which game is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.20,0:04:56.14,Main Dialogue Left,,0,0,0,,Can we make some photos?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.77,0:04:56.14,Main Dialogue Right,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.83,0:04:58.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.74,0:04:59.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I sense it wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.26,0:05:00.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.44,0:05:02.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Double Deadly Alliance"?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.37,0:05:04.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's a two-player game.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rules allow any console game, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And this is the one we're good at.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.13,0:05:10.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can choose a partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.99,0:05:12.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, can you play that?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.42,0:05:13.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can walk back and forth.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.69,0:05:14.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better than nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.98,0:05:15.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.16,0:05:17.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.45,0:05:18.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll play with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's only one prize.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.55,0:05:21.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need the prize.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.00,0:05:23.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it wouldn't be fair to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.72,0:05:25.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be with my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.30,0:05:26.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we lose, so what?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.21,0:05:27.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you, little girl!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.50,0:05:31.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it like that, sir...!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.78,0:05:34.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll play.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.73,0:05:35.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.63,0:05:36.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not that good.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.94,0:05:37.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never won.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.50,0:05:39.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem! Come!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.17,0:05:42.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not so glorious to win like that, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.18,0:05:43.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll still do our best!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.43,0:05:52.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your controllers disconnected?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.71,0:05:53.79,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(138,84)}Directed by:\NMutou
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.71,0:05:53.79,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(456,76)}Character design:\NBiti
