Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.79,0:05:53.88,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(918,46)}Modeling:\NDa Shuang\NLulu\NDa Huang
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.79,0:05:53.88,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1450,96)}Kui Zhi\NLittle Fish (Xiao Yu)
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.79,0:05:53.88,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328,878)}Design:\NFenmo\NDandan
