Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.97,0:06:00.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This didn't work.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.09,0:06:03.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like a lot of humans like me...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.78,0:06:09.69,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.58,0:06:11.43,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.26,0:06:13.15,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.66,0:06:15.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xuanli?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.35,0:06:20.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for them to come out?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.12,0:06:21.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.16,0:06:23.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must wrap this up soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.40,0:06:25.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Polao.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.44,0:06:26.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please go in for them.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.44,0:06:30.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Going in I certainly can,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.41,0:06:33.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I have no ability to sense the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.71,0:06:35.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They haven't moved for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are in the southeast corner.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.65,0:06:38.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A black cat.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Must be easy to find.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.45,0:06:42.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Southeast corner...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.50,0:06:45.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can indeed feel spirit aura there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.00,0:06:46.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right then.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will wait for the opportunity.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.73,0:06:51.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.01,0:06:53.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We leave it to you, old frog.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Old frog?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.49,0:06:58.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's already gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.23,0:07:00.98,Episode title 24,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1076,712)}Unwritten Rule
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.07,0:07:04.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That must be him.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.60,0:07:07.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.39,0:07:07.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must have heard me...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.47,0:07:15.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he answer?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.65,0:07:17.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.21,0:07:19.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haven't you met Xiaobai?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.83,0:07:20.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm with her.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.41,0:07:23.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.51,0:07:25.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some spirits are looking for them.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.78,0:07:26.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are already here.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.72,0:07:27.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.45,0:07:38.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen, my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You left without a word.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.02,0:07:44.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to keep your promise?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.62,0:07:46.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said I'd tell him to give it to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.66,0:07:48.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, give it to them.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.20,0:07:48.56,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.76,0:07:49.41,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.75,0:07:50.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're angry only because I could escape.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.21,0:07:55.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it was rather impolite?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was locking me up a polite thing to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.05,0:08:02.48,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Anyone who possesses the prize of a vow quest, must bear the risk of robbery.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.96,0:08:05.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an unwritten rule of vow quests.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is this an unwritten rule?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.81,0:08:08.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just that Laozi won't intervene.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.16,0:08:11.52,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows he can't deal with events on Earth.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.72,0:08:15.23,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,When some people started to say this, the others accepted it as a rule.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.85,0:08:19.98,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,In the end, you're just looking for a reason to justify robbery.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.69,0:08:23.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or do you really think this is fair?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You would've beaten me.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you afraid now of getting hurt?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I've got Diting.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.95,0:08:33.65,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Lord Diting can't get involved with the Pearl, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.13,0:08:34.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.95,0:08:35.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.91,0:08:38.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he does, I'll give him a hard time!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.51,0:08:39.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.60,0:08:40.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Behave yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stupid old frog!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you're the boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.49,0:08:46.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This so-called Diting, maybe he's a fake!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.74,0:08:47.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.63,0:08:49.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm burning up!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please excuse him.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Sky Pearl!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.67,0:09:03.45,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you need it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.64,0:09:04.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need for you to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.28,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if I don't give it up?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.57,0:09:07.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we'll take it by force.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.30,0:09:09.27,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what if the moment you attack,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.76,0:09:10.45,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I give it to Diting?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.71,0:09:12.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.47,0:09:14.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What good would it make to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.27,0:09:15.00,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can't keep it,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.09,0:09:15.83,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel better if you feel bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.65,0:09:21.55,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think I won't do it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two made up this scheme!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.26,0:09:26.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.49,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But I certainly wouldn't mind to retrieve the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I give you my word,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.33,0:09:34.14,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,that if I get the Pearl, I won't give it to him again.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.75,0:09:41.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qingqiu.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.47,0:09:44.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd better tell them.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.45,0:09:54.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't accept prize robbery as a rule either.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.56,0:09:56.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.35,0:09:58.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we didn't wish to do it like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.56,0:10:01.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we need the Pearl so much,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.83,0:10:03.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we would give anything for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it possible you're willing to part with it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.22,0:10:09.86,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.47,0:10:14.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To save our friend's life.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.03,0:10:15.57,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.85,0:10:18.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid! Why should we lie to you now?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.32,0:10:21.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It smells nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.47,0:10:24.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sassy brat! Do you want me to eat you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.68,0:10:26.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He isn't lying.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.00,0:10:27.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.24,0:10:31.45,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,To avoid being deceived, Master Lao lent me the Mind-Discerning Mirror.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.87,0:10:32.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How convenient.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just give it to them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.66,0:10:37.44,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,If it was that simple, we wouldn't have done all this!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do have any idea what it is for?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.15,0:10:40.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Easy to say so.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.69,0:10:42.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.34,0:10:46.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really give it to us?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.08,0:10:47.76,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should have said so earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.01,0:10:49.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.51,0:10:53.30,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,It's the Sky Pearl! The hell thought you'd just give it away!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what it can do?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.09,0:10:55.63,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can give it back.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.86,0:10:58.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shame on us...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.35,0:11:00.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We humbly accept the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.39,0:11:03.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you are ever in need of our help,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just inquire at the club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.83,0:11:07.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will be at your service.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.71,0:11:10.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are brothers now!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.53,0:11:11.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.49,0:11:12.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still hate you!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.81,0:11:14.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We wish to bring home the news right away.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.51,0:11:16.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must say goodbye now.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.12,0:11:17.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya later, little spirits!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.42,0:11:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.29,0:11:25.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're clients of the club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.97,0:11:27.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Couldn't Laozi have helped them?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.89,0:11:29.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it was that simple,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.67,0:11:32.48,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,the Pearl wouldn't have stayed at Master Lao for centuries.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.41,0:11:35.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how could Xiaohei take it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With his ability.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.66,0:11:38.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And because he's strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.79,0:11:41.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he stronger even than Gen?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.07,0:11:43.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before I wounded him,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he was stronger than Xuanli right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.63,0:11:47.77,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.99,0:11:48.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.46,0:11:49.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.21,0:11:53.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've said too much.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.00,0:11:55.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.04,0:11:56.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kitten.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.60,0:11:59.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gave up the Pearl too easily.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't regret it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.28,0:12:08.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.75,0:12:10.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Xiaohei who made him angry.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.76,0:12:14.42,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,After all, the Pearl has a special significance for him and Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.95,0:12:15.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to say...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.12,0:12:17.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really gave it up easily.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.89,0:12:18.63,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They needed it more.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Sky Pearl can heal illnesses?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.58,0:12:23.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only one type of illness.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.59,0:12:25.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's not why spirits want it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why do they want it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.15,0:12:28.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What makes it so precious,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.51,0:12:30.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is that if an ordinary spirit gets it,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.85,0:12:33.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he can become an immortal.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.80,0:12:34.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
