Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.66,0:13:10.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Immortal?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.31,0:13:12.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.61,0:13:14.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's basically a life elixir?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.75,0:13:15.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can say that.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.22,0:13:17.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it makes anyone an immortal,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.95,0:13:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,aren't there many people who want it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.30,0:13:21.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because it's not that easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.76,0:13:24.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the hardest quest in the books of vows.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.41,0:13:25.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's in Master Lao's realm,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,protected by powerful barriers.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, no one considers it a target.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.64,0:13:32.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.78,0:13:34.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the case of Xiaohei,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.09,0:13:36.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if he's within a certain range,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.77,0:13:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,barriers are as if they're not there.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.78,0:13:40.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.83,0:13:42.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect ability for stealing.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.81,0:13:43.48,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be jealous...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.84,0:13:47.39,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,And aren't there any very strong spirits who need it?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.85,0:13:48.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.76,0:13:49.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But those spirits
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.04,0:13:52.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,don't want to offend Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.63,0:13:55.28,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,After all it's just a game he made up to amuse himself.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.74,0:13:57.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.56,0:14:00.08,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,you just gave up on the chance to become an immortal?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.06,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't use it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.08,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it just brings trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.02,0:14:06.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why did all the trouble find me...?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.89,0:14:11.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.84,0:14:13.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hoped for a bit of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,596)}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.45,0:14:23.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen, why are you here?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.90,0:14:24.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Had something to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.95,0:14:25.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you win?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.11,0:14:26.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.90,0:14:27.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.53,0:14:29.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a console exclusive to the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.95,0:14:32.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Limited edition.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.07,0:14:33.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A 1000 were made.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A 1000 pieces?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.60,0:14:36.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a lot?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.60,0:14:40.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're still so clueless.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.55,0:14:42.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were 10 million preorders on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's the difference?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.94,0:14:45.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.13,0:14:46.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.06,0:14:48.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll know when the time comes.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The point is that I have it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.67,0:14:52.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.45,0:14:54.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you give me the box from yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.06,0:14:58.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you keep it??
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I noticed that your box looks like mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.89,0:15:06.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the limited edition too!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.58,0:15:07.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.72,0:15:08.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a gift.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.15,0:15:09.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.01,0:15:12.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that we both have it, we can play together.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.39,0:15:12.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You play Gate of the Living, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my player ID.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.27,0:15:20.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can friend me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.42,0:15:21.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alrighty.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.68,0:15:31.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are they doing at the door?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they're pretty dirty too.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.86,0:15:35.30,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.17,0:15:41.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.97,0:15:42.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huang.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.78,0:15:43.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.87,0:15:45.47,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.71,0:15:46.46,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.24,0:15:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.33,0:15:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, we're back!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.20,0:16:01.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come you're back only now?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.75,0:16:03.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you come yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.74,0:16:04.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.85,0:16:06.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a long story...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.37,0:16:06.90,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.85,0:16:09.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I brought the money.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.35,0:16:11.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.47,0:16:32.30,Episode title 25,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2300,0)\pos(406,462)}Early Morning\NCrescent Moon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.78,0:16:47.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening, right in the morning?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.18,0:18:00.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.04,0:18:01.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
